/// ResourceSelector: Defines a selector to identify a single or a group of resources. Conditions in the selector are optional, but at least one field should be set to a non-empty value. If a condition is not specified, no restrictions will be applied on that dimension. If more than one condition is specified, a resource will be selected if and only if all conditions are met.
